  <head>
    <ce:title>Bioactive silicate and borate glass matrices: Compositional dependence of thermal stability, density, and elastic modulus</ce:title>
    <ce:abstract>
      <ce:simple-para>Silicate glasses with osteogenic potential are widely utilized in biomedical implants. This investigation reports the oxide compositions, density, glass transition temperature, and Young's modulus across silicate and borosilicate bioglass systems.</ce:simple-para>
    </ce:abstract>
  </head>
